          "kicker": "Discipline lapse",
          "heading": "Mesake Vocevoce sent off for 10 minutes as Fiji lost to France",
          "body": "Fiji were left a man light in Lyon: Islands Business's Alipate Pareti reports that Mesake Vocevoce was sent off for 10 minutes for collapsing a driving maul, and the Flying Fijians backpedalled as France's forwards pressed on. Pareti also notes that Vinaya Habosi was playing inside centre for the first time and that Fiji won some lineout battles, but Pareti argues they should have contested France's lineouts to stop the mauls forming."
