      "edition": "Friday 13 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Mindset talk",
          "heading": "Kolisi says history gives Springboks no edge at Stade de France",
          "body": "Siya Kolisi, the Springboks captain, has dismissed any psychological edge from history ahead of Friday's clash at the Stade de France. 'What happened last year is gone,' Kolisi said on Thursday, after winning the 2025 meeting 32-17. He said the group has changed and that they 'don't get stuck on things that have happened before.' France, by contrast, have beaten South Africa once in their past 10 meetings, in Marseille in 2022."
        },
        {
