          "kicker": "Debut watch",
          "heading": "James McNabney poised for Ireland debut off the bench against Fiji",
          "body": "Ulster's James McNabney has been named among the replacements for Saturday's clash with Fiji at the Aviva Stadium, with a first cap on the cards if he is called on. The 23-year-old has started just one game for Ulster this season after an anterior cruciate ligament injury forced him to miss the entire 2025-26 campaign. Ireland head coach Andy Farrell called his rise \"phenomenal\"."
