          "heading": "Italy visit Gaslini hospital and meet fans during Genoa build-up",
          "body": "Italy's delegation visited Genoa's Ospedale Gaslini on Thursday, meeting young patients and their families. Today brings a Captain's Run at the Stadio Luigi Ferraris, a press conference for the captain, a photo shoot with the Canile Monte Contessa animal shelter and a meeting with supporters at the Macron Store on via Canevari. The day closes with an awards evening for Ligurian rugby, organised by the Federazione Italiana Rugby and CUS Genova, followed by the Committee Dinner."
