          "kicker": "School rugby link",
          "heading": "Tuipulotu's schoolmate Jacob Elordi ended rugby after breaking his back at 16",
          "body": "Ahead of the Australia Test, talkSPORT reports that Scotland international Sione Tuipulotu shared a school team at St Kevin's College in Melbourne with actor Jacob Elordi. Elordi told the Hollywood Reporter in January that he broke his back at 16 after lifting weights too early and squatting wrong, then went into a tackle, and a rugby coach had asked him to choose between sport and drama. Scotland team-mate Blair Kinghorn says Tuipulotu still claims he is the school's most famous former pupil."
        },
        {
