          "heading": "Italy coach Gonzalo Quesada expects Pumas to come out swinging in Genoa",
          "body": "Italy head coach Gonzalo Quesada has given his read on the Pumas ahead of Saturday's match in Genoa. He says Argentina arrive with more defeats than they are used to, have taken criticism and have voiced their own disappointment. Italy have prepared on the contest, defence and discipline, Quesada said, and he expects \"Mi immagino un’Argentina all’arrembaggio e che metterà tutta la sua aggressività fin dal primo minuto.\" He also flagged the aerial game the Pumas use a lot."
