          "kicker": "Backline debate",
          "heading": "Wallabies scrum-half Ryan Lonergan defends Joseph Suaalii after Chris Ashton's criticism",
          "body": "Scrum-half Ryan Lonergan has backed Joseph Suaalii after the winger drew criticism following Australia's 45-22 loss to England at Twickenham. Lonergan told reporters Suaalii was \"a great team-mate, great athlete\" and said the back three were not getting opportunities through any fault of their own. Former England winger Chris Ashton had questioned whether the ex-rugby league star looked like a union international. Lonergan also said collisions were the main point from the Wallabies' defensive review ahead of Sunday's Murrayfield test against Scotland."
        },
        {
